{
  "_purpose": "Reference dataset of real, currently-active store scans, bifurcated by stage because each stage has a different function and only ever produces a subset of this data in the real app. Not a test fixture consumed by test runners — a running accuracy log for manually or programmatically comparing future scans of the same URLs against what was observed here, to catch drift or regressions in the diagnostic engine. Update by appending new entries with a fresh scannedAt, never overwrite history.",
